{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/8d77d2f31fbc61c92af4b0c17020f98a.webp?t=1764788451\" width=600 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a carefree adventure where there are no clocks, scores, or stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide where to go and what to discover. Explore picturesque locations, solve clever environmental puzzles, and uncover secrets at your own pace, without time pressure or enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on freedom of action and peaceful exploration, perfect for relaxing after a hard day, for both adults and younger players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its friendly aesthetics and intuitive mechanics, it's ideal for playing with the family, a dose of weekend relaxation, or moments of solitary reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/72ee22a76995f8172a75d8127d271a5d.avif?t=1764788451\" width=400 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why you'll love Skull Seeker. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clever environmental puzzles: Use logic and observation to unlock paths and uncover the secrets of the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy atmosphere: Immerse yourself in stylized 3D graphics, full of vibrant colors and a warm atmosphere.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm exploration: Wander through locations in third-person view, enjoying the freedom to take your time.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family-friendly: Safe and engaging fun for players of all ages.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious adventure: Follow the clues to uncover the mystery of the ancient Skull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore three islands and ancient underground dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/06fb97d76b369212ef8875ea9615c60a.poster.avif?t=1764788451\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/06fb97d76b369212ef8875ea9615c60a.webm?t=1764788451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect hidden collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/f75511cd9773221d5358526dc2d13e03.poster.avif?t=1764788451\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/f75511cd9773221d5358526dc2d13e03.webm?t=1764788451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Avoid the traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/fd045918f25185a19231c08502de2218.poster.avif?t=1764788451\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/fd045918f25185a19231c08502de2218.webm?t=1764788451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/00d69fb4cd660f91402234adb89e8f14.poster.avif?t=1764788451\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/00d69fb4cd660f91402234adb89e8f14.webm?t=1764788451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use found items to solve puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/33284836acb299cdba390d7a911d4689.poster.avif?t=1764788451\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/33284836acb299cdba390d7a911d4689.webm?t=1764788451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for a Relaxing Journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the quest in Skull Seeker and discover a world full of charm and puzzles. Add it to your wishlist today or try the demo to start your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1625170?t=1764788451","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764788451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/79c299e1432aee01f76bb763c30b51ffee3d09a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764788451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/79c299e1432aee01f76bb763c30b51ffee3d09a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764788451","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4170550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb